---
// The chapter's key sentence: the one idea to remember and the place to start reading. h2 size, Regular,
// ink, at the top of the body lane, before everything else in the chapter.
//   <Key>The problem was never motivation: it was the effort between intention and plate.</Key>
---

<p class="key" data-reveal><slot /></p>

<style>
  .key {
    max-width: 20em;
    font-size: var(--fs-h2);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .key {
      max-width: none;
    }
  }
</style>
